<section id="users-view"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE & ACCESS</p><h1>Team members</h1><p class="muted">Create Church Admin accounts for church staff. Developer Super Admin accounts also have user management and monitoring access.</p></div></div><form id="user-form" class="panel form-grid"><label>Full name<input class="form-control" name="displayName" maxlength="120" required></label><label>Email<input class="form-control" name="email" type="email" maxlength="256" required></label><label>Initial password<input class="form-control" name="password" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password" required></label><div><label for="new-user-role" class="mb-2">Role</label><select id="new-user-role" class="form-select" name="role"><option value="ChurchAdmin">Church Admin</option><option>Writer</option><option>BlogEditor</option><option>MediaManager</option><option>CommunicationsManager</option><option value="SuperAdmin">Developer Super Admin</option></select></div><p class="muted small">Passwords need at least 12 characters with uppercase, lowercase, a number and a symbol. Share initial credentials through a private channel.</p><button class="btn btn-primary primary" type="submit">Create team account</button></form><div class="panel table-wrap"><table class="table table-hover"><thead><tr><th>NAME</th><th>EMAIL</th><th>ROLE</th><th>ACCESS</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="user-rows"></tbody></table><div class="pager"><button id="user-prev" class="btn btn-outline-secondary outline">Previous</button><span id="user-page"></span><button id="user-next" class="btn btn-outline-secondary outline">Next</button></div></div></section>
    